to have a home.

799
00:49:27,917 --> 00:49:29,707
You shouldn't have come.

800
00:49:29,708 --> 00:49:30,917
Ah!

801
00:49:31,708 --> 00:49:32,874
Valkyrie!

802
00:49:32,875 --> 00:49:35,749
Great to see you, angry girl!

803
00:49:35,750 --> 00:49:37,958
I think I liked you better
either of the other ways.

804
00:49:39,208 --> 00:49:41,000
- This is Rocket.
- How ya doing?

805
00:49:43,417 --> 00:49:44,417
He won't see you.

806
00:49:44,750 --> 00:49:45,832
It's that bad, huh?

807
00:49:45,833 --> 00:49:47,374
We only see him once a month

808
00:49:47,375 --> 00:49:50,583
when he comes in
for "supplies."

809
00:49:51,667 --> 00:49:52,957
It's that bad.

810
00:49:52,958 --> 00:49:53,958
Yeah.

811
00:50:06,458 --> 00:50:07,582
What the...?

812
00:50:10,000 --> 00:50:12,707
Whew! Something died in here!

813
