Boys! Oh, my God!

819
00:50:37,208 --> 00:50:39,958
Oh, my God,
it's so good to see you!

820
00:50:41,417 --> 00:50:42,874
Come here,
cuddly little rascal.

821
00:50:42,875 --> 00:50:45,499
Yeah, no, I'm good. I'm good.

822
00:50:45,500 --> 00:50:46,583
That's not necessary.

823
00:50:47,042 --> 00:50:49,874
Hulk, you know my friends
Miek and Korg, right?

824
00:50:49,875 --> 00:50:51,041
- Hey, boys!
-  Hey, guys.

825
00:50:51,042 --> 00:50:52,457
Long time no see.

826
00:50:52,458 --> 00:50:54,999
Beer's in the bucket. Feel
free to log on to the Wi-Fi.

827
00:50:55,000 --> 00:50:56,708
No password, obviously.

828
00:50:57,792 --> 00:50:59,332
Thor, he's back.

829
00:50:59,333 --> 00:51:02,125
That kid on the TV just
called me a dickhead again.

830
00:51:02,667 --> 00:51:03,874
Noobmaster.

831
00:51:03,875 --> 00:51:06,499
Yeah, NoobMaster69
called me a dickhead.

832
00:51:06,500 --> 00:51:07,667
