Noobmaster, hey,
it's Thor again.

834
00:51:10,417 --> 00:51:11,541
You know, the God of Thunder.

835
00:51:11,542 --> 00:51:13,999
Listen, bud, if you don't log
off this game immediately...

836
00:51:14,000 --> 00:51:15,541
