843
00:51:26,708 --> 00:51:27,917
Thank you very much. I will.

844
00:51:28,708 --> 00:51:30,374
So, you guys want a drink?
What are we drinking?

845
00:51:30,375 --> 00:51:32,792
I've got beer, tequila,
