857
00:52:15,708 --> 00:52:18,542
Don't say that name.

858
00:52:19,292 --> 00:52:22,375
Um, yeah, we don't actually
say that name in here.

859
00:52:27,208 --> 00:52:29,083
Please take your hand off me.

860
