Now, I know that guy...

861
00:52:36,458 --> 00:52:37,749
might scare you.

862
00:52:37,750 --> 00:52:39,291
Why would I be...?

863
00:52:39,292 --> 00:52:42,624
Why would I be scared
of that guy?

864
00:52:42,625 --> 00:52:44,458
I'm the one who
killed that guy, remember?

865
00:52:45,792 --> 00:52:47,667
