866
00:52:51,083 --> 00:52:52,167
Nope.

867
00:52:52,708 --> 00:52:53,708
Didn't think so.

868
00:52:54,792 --> 00:52:56,707
Korg, why don't you
tell everybody

869
00:52:56,708 --> 00:52:59,166
