big head off?

870
00:52:59,167 --> 00:53:00,791
Um, Stormbreaker?

871
00:53:00,792 --> 00:53:02,417
Who was swinging
Stormbreaker?

872
00:53:06,500 --> 00:53:08,874
I get it.
You're in a rough spot, okay?

873
00:53:08,875 --> 00:53:09,916
I've been there myself.

874
00:53:09,917 --> 00:53:12,374
And you want to know
who helped me out of it?

875
00:53:12,375 --> 00:53:14,833
Was it Natasha?

876
00:53:15,292 --> 00:53:17,332
It was you.

877
00:53:17,333 --> 00:53:19,292
You helped me.

878
00:53:20,500 --> 00:53:21,958
So, why don't you ask...

879
00:53:23,042 --> 00:53:25,541
the Asgardians down there...

880
00:53:25,542 --> 00:53:27,250
