881
00:53:32,917 --> 00:53:34,375
The ones
that are left, anyway.

882
00:53:34,917 --> 00:53:36,832
I think we could
bring them back.

883
00:53:36,833 --> 00:53:38,417
Stop.

884
00:53:39,542 --> 00:53:40,625
Stop, okay?

885
00:53:41,375 --> 00:53:42,541
I know you think I'm down here

886
00:53:42,542 --> 00:53:44,457
wallowing in
my own self-pity...

887
00:53:44,458 --> 00:53:47,166
waiting to be rescued
and saved...

888
00:53:47,167 --> 00:53:49,291
but I'm fine, okay.
We're fine, aren't we?

889
00:53:49,292 --> 00:53:51,041
We're good here, mate.

890
00:53:51,042 --> 00:53:53,166
So, whatever it is that you're
offering, we're not into it.

891
00:53:53,167 --> 00:53:54,832
Don't care.
Couldn't care less.

892
00:53:54,833 --> 00:53:55,917
Goodbye.

893
00:53:59,292 --> 00:54:01,000
We need you, pal.

894
00:54:10,417 --> 00:54:12,417
There's beer on the ship.

895
00:54:16,458 --> 00:54:18,124
